## Project Philosophy

### Core Principles
1. **Simplicity**: Proste rozwiązanie dla prostego problemu
2. **Maintainability**: Łatwe dodawanie nowych punktów
3. **Performance**: Szybkie ładowanie (w ramach ograniczeń)
4. **Reliability**: Defensive programming, error prevention

### What This Project Is
- Showcase dla lokalnych biznesów
- Narzędzie dla turystów
- Projekt współfinansowany przez UE
- Production-ready static web app

### What This Project Is NOT
- Complex SPA z routing
- Mobile-first application
- Real-time data platform
- Multi-user system with auth

## Success Metrics (Assumed)

### Primary
- Map loads < 3s
- All 25 points visible
- All links work
- Professional appearance

### Secondary
- User engagement (via future analytics)
- Business feedback
- Tourist satisfaction
- Grant compliance

## Future-Proofing Notes

### If Scaling Beyond 50 Points
- Consider marker clustering
- Implement lazy loading
- Add pagination to cards
- Optimize bundle size

### If Adding Mobile Support
- Redesign for responsive
- Test on various devices
- Consider touch interactions
- Optimize for smaller screens

### If Internationalizing
- i18n framework (react-intl, i18next)
- Translate all UI strings
- Consider URL routing per language
- RTL support if needed

